<title>USA: Fingermatrix closes limited offering.</title>
<headline>Fingermatrix closes limited offering.</headline>
<dateline>DOBBS FERRY, N.Y. 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finger/Matrix Inc said Thursday that it is closing on the private offering of its common shares limited to &quot;accredited investors.&quot;</p>
<p>The offering resulted in the receipt of about $226,000 in capital financing, the company said.</p>
<p>The stock was sold to current stockholders in units of 2,000 shares, with sale or transfer restricted for at least one year, the company said.</p>
